Invoke :program:`west build` and :program:`west flash`:

   .. rubric:: On ARM Cortex-M33

   .. zephyr-app-commands::
      :app: zephyr/samples/sensor/accel_polling
      :build-dir: picoboy_color_plus
      :board: picoboy_color_plus/rp2350a/m33
      :west-args: -p
      :goals: flash
      :compact:

   .. rubric:: On Hazard3 RISC-V (RV32IMAC+)

   .. zephyr-app-commands::
      :app: zephyr/samples/sensor/accel_polling
      :build-dir: picoboy_color_plus
      :board: picoboy_color_plus/rp2350a/hazard3
      :west-args: -p
      :goals: flash
      :compact:

